- Audit production setelah perubahan: 0 advisory pada semua severity, exit code 0. Referensi baseline: https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-jrc7-96c5-q579 (MapLibre) dan https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-fxqj-rqcc-2cmp (batas patch PostCSS terbaru dari audit).
